, "language": "english", "review": "Absolutely love this game and will always love it.\n\nPROS:\n- Really unique game design (characters, enemies, world-building, lore, etc.)\n- It's rewarding to progress, as there is A LOT to unlock\n- Steam achievement and trading card supported\n- Has really fun multiplayer (if you can make it work)\n- The music is unbelievable, it's on Spotify, I have it on vinyl, you will love it\n- Serious replay value, gameplay changes with every character and unlock you find\n\nCONS:\n- Daunting learning curve\n- Difficult, unforgiving gameplay\n- Buggy, game has a small handful of bugs that will force you to restart or crash the game itself\n- Endgame is buggy and unbalanced, the game only functions up to a certain degree after completing main objective\n- If you aren't tech savvy you may struggle when setting up multiplayer (I got it to work but it was not easy for me at least)\n\nThis game is breathtaking, challenging, and incredibly worth the purchase. Buy the 4-pack and share it, you won't regret it.", "timestamp_created": 1622241251, "timestamp_updated": 1622241251, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 7, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.60520404577255249", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 6, "count": 1}]}]}